License notices in the amtrak-gtfs-rt image
============================================

Amtrak GTFS-RT is licensed AGPL-3.0-only. The image also contains third-party software under
its own licenses. This file lists where each component's notices are. Nothing here is
generated: every notice is the one its component ships, copied into /licenses or left in place.
scripts/verify-release-image.sh checks that each location below exists before a release.

Copied into /licenses
---------------------

/licenses/AGPL-3.0-only.txt
    The project license (the repository's LICENSE file).

/licenses/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.html
    Every Rust crate compiled into /usr/local/bin/amtrak-gtfs-rt-service, including the
    catenarytransit/amtrak-gtfs-rt crate (AGPL-3.0). Generated by cargo-about from Cargo.lock
    (scripts/generate-third-party-licenses.sh) and checked in.

/licenses/gtfs-validator/LICENSE
    MobilityData GTFS validator v8.0.1 (Apache-2.0), from the digest-checked source the JAR at
    /opt/amtrak/gtfs-validator-v8.0.1-amtrak-hardened.1-cli.jar is rebuilt from. The libraries
    bundled in that JAR keep their notices in its META-INF/ directory.

/licenses/playwright-browsers/<browser>/
    Copied at build time from Playwright's browser downloads under /ms-playwright:
    chromium_headless_shell/LICENSE.headless_shell (Chromium and its third-party code) and
    ffmpeg/COPYING.LGPLv2.1. An image built with BROWSER_BUNDLE=full also has chromium/, whose
    Chromium is the same revision as the headless shell.

Left in place
-------------

/usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright
    Every Debian package (`dpkg-query -W` lists them), including tini, the Chromium shared
    libraries, and fonts-liberation.

/usr/local/lib/python3.12/LICENSE.txt
    CPython, from the python:3.12-slim-bookworm base.

/usr/local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/*.dist-info/licenses/
    Each installed Python package: playwright, cryptography, and their dependencies (cffi,
    greenlet, pycparser, pyee, typing_extensions).

/usr/local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/playwright/driver/LICENSE
/usr/local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/playwright/driver/package/ThirdPartyNotices.txt
    The Node.js runtime bundled with Playwright, and the Playwright driver's own third-party
    notices.

/opt/java/legal/<module>/
    The jlink'd Eclipse Temurin 17 runtime (GPL-2.0 with the Classpath Exception) and the
    third-party code in each module it includes.

Source for the AGPL-3.0 service is at https://github.com/TracksideTransport/Amtrak-GTFS-RT, at the
revision in the image's org.opencontainers.image.revision label.
